            "\\paragraph{LLMs are confident in their response.} Beyond observing textual responses, we also investigate how confident the LLMs are in their responses.\n",
            "With Llama2-7B as a case study, we report the log probabilities for the token it generates, after normalizing over all three tokens representing memory answer, counter-answer, and uncertain.\n",
            "Specifically, we mainly explore two scenarios:\n",
            "\n",
